<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lincoln Tech Hub - Grade 1-4 Lab 1</title>
<style>
    @page {
        size: A4;
        margin: 15mm;
    }
    body {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        font-size: 13pt;
        color: #000;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .logo-header {
        text-align: center;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #0a4d68;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .logo {
        height: 90px; /* bigger logo at top */
    }
    .title {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 15px 0;
    }
    .title h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 20pt;
        color: #0a4d68;
    }
    .title h2 {
        margin: 5px 0 0 0;
        font-size: 15pt;
        font-weight: normal;
    }
    .student-info {
        margin: 15px 0 20px 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 12pt;
    }
    .student-info div {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
        padding: 4px 0;
    }
    .task {
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .task h3 {
        color: #0a4d68;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-size: 14pt;
    }
    .task ol {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 25px;
    }
    .task ol li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .sub-list {
        margin-top: 5px;
        padding-left: 25px;
    }
    .sub-list li {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="logo-header">
        <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/clematik/clematik.github.io/refs/heads/main/lincoln_tech_hub_logo.jpeg" alt="Lincoln Tech Hub Logo" class="logo">
    </div>

    <div class="title">
        <h1>Coding and Robotics Practical</h1>
        <h2>Grade 1 - 4 | Lab 1</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="student-info">
        <div><strong>Name:</strong> _________________________________</div>
        <div><strong>Grade:</strong> _________________________________</div>
    </div>

    <div class="task">
        <h3>1. Micro:bit with MakeCode</h3>
        <p>Write a program for the Micro:bit using MakeCode that does the following:</p>
        <ol class="sub-list">
            <li>Create a new project and name it with your Full Name.</li>
            <li>Display the heart symbol ❤️ on the LED screen.</li>
            <li>Make the heart symbol blink ON and OFF every 1 second continuously.</li>
            <li>Your program must use a loop.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="task">
        <h3>2. ScratchJr Animation</h3>
        <p>Create an animated scenario in ScratchJr.</p>
        <ol class="sub-list">
            <li>Add two sprites of your choice to the stage.</li>
            <li>Change the backdrop to any backdrop of your choice.</li>
            <li>Create a scenario of your choice where the two sprites interact.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
